jx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>21</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>22</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
